      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T02:10:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why require pinned clang? Tint has been built this way from the start without requiring a specific clang. We got a handful of errors but we just added suppressions (or fixed them) and folks could still turn of everything manually.",
      "revId": "438e7533b7e7cbeeb41a9c095bfd38357190cf00",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
